    url: "https://www.99minds.io/integrations/klaviyo",
    title: "Klaviyo Integration with 99minds",
    description: "Increase sales with Klaviyo. Send targeted emails, Facebook, and Instagram ads. Perfect for online stores focused on growth.",
    
